<title>UK: All three Brent dates kept - trade.</title>
<headline>All three Brent dates kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum kept all three Dated Brent cargoes nominated from the paper chains on Monday evening, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargoes, two of which were deferred from Friday, were due to load during September 24-26.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
